      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Bxdp6",
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{4.5}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{X}_{2}=0.1 \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\mathrm{n}_{2}}{\\mathrm{n}_{2}+\\mathrm{n}_{1}}=0.1$ $\\ldots(1)$\r\n$\\mathrm{M}=\\frac{\\mathrm{W}_{2} \\times 1000}{\\mathrm{M}_{2} \\times \\mathrm{W}} \\times \\mathrm{d}$ $\\ldots(2)$\r\n$\\mathrm{m}=\\frac{\\mathrm{W}_{2} \\times 1000}{\\mathrm{M}_{2} \\times \\mathrm{W}_{1}(\\mathrm{~g})}$ $\\ldots(3)$\r\n$\\mathrm{d}=2 \\mathrm{~g} / \\mathrm{cc}$ $\\ldots(4)$\r\nGiven M = m (numerically)\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\\Rightarrow \\frac{\\mathrm{W}_{2} \\times 1000}{\\mathrm{M}_{2} \\times\\left(\\mathrm{W}_{2}+\\mathrm{W}_{1}\\right)} \\times \\mathrm{d}=\\frac{\\mathrm{W}_{2} \\times 1000}{\\mathrm{M}_{2} \\times \\mathrm{W}_{1}(\\mathrm{~g})} \\\\\r\n\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{W}_{2}+\\mathrm{W}_{1}=\\mathrm{W}_{1} \\times \\mathrm{d}=2 \\mathrm{~W}_{1} \\\\ \r\n\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{W}_{2}=\\mathrm{W}_{1} \r\n\\end{array}$ \r\nNow, $\\frac{n_{2}}{n_{2}+n_{1}}=0.1 \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\frac{w_{2}}{M_{2}}}{\\frac{W_{2}}{M_{2}}+\\frac{W_{1}}{M_{1}}}=0.1 \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\frac{W_{2}}{M_{2}}}{W_{2}\\left(\\frac{1}{M_{2}}+\\frac{1}{M_{1}}\\right)}=0.1$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{M}_{2}}}{\\frac{\\mathrm{M}_{1}+\\mathrm{M}_{2}}{\\mathrm{M}_{1} \\mathrm{M}_{2}}}=0.1 \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\mathrm{M}_{1}}{\\mathrm{M}_{1}+\\mathrm{M}_{2}}=\\frac{1}{10} \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\mathrm{M}_{1}}{\\mathrm{M}_{1}+\\mathrm{M}_{2}-\\mathrm{M}_{1}}=\\frac{1}{10-1} \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\mathrm{M}_{1}}{\\mathrm{M}_{2}}=\\frac{1}{9} \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\mathrm{M}_{2}}{\\mathrm{M}_{1}}=9$",
    "image": null
  },
